{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826060929335552","locale":"jp","text":"ペイペイ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826060929335808","locale":"jp","text":"ペイペイ……一所懸命……修行中……です！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826065224302848","locale":"jp","text":"ペイペイ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826065224303104","locale":"jp","text":"いきま――うわわっ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826069519270144","locale":"jp","text":"ペイペイ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826069519270400","locale":"jp","text":"はっ！ふっ！えい――やあっ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826073814237440","locale":"jp","text":"ペイペイ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826073814237696","locale":"jp","text":"ふぅ、あぶなかったぁ……"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826078109204736","locale":"jp","text":"ペイペイ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826078109204992","locale":"jp","text":"いきますよ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826082404172032","locale":"jp","text":"ペイペイ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826082404172288","locale":"jp","text":"えいっ！はっ！ええい〜ふっ……"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826086699139328","locale":"jp","text":"ペイペイ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433826086699139584","locale":"jp","text":"どうでしたか？"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834650863927552","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834650863927808","locale":"jp","text":"ねぇ、毬つきしようよ？"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834655158894848","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834655158895104","locale":"jp","text":"はっ――やっ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834659453862144","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834659453862400","locale":"jp","text":"もう一回？"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834663748829440","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834663748829696","locale":"jp","text":"ふっ、やっ、そぉれ！どう？えへっ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834668043796736","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834668043796992","locale":"jp","text":"うちはまだまだ、こんなもんじゃないよ～\nほら、続けよ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834672338764032","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834672338764288","locale":"jp","text":"あれ？どっか行っちゃった？"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834676633731328","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834676633731584","locale":"jp","text":"うー、あんな奥に……"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834680928698624","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834680928698880","locale":"jp","text":"ふふっ、よーし！いくよっ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834685223665920","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834685223666176","locale":"jp","text":"もう一回やってみよ？"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834689518633216","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834689518633472","locale":"jp","text":"いっくよ――"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834693813600512","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834693813600768","locale":"jp","text":"わわっ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834698108567808","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:433834698108568064","locale":"jp","text":"ううっ……もう、もっと優しくしてよぅ！"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570094901559552","locale":"jp","text":"メーツァ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570094901559808","locale":"jp","text":"きゃっ、もう……イタズラはだめよ。"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570099196526848","locale":"jp","text":"メーツァ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570099196527104","locale":"jp","text":"ううーん……もうすこし休んでいっていいのよ。"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570103491494144","locale":"jp","text":"メーツァ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570103491494400","locale":"jp","text":"あら？私のことを思い出してくれてうれしいわ。"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570107786461440","locale":"jp","text":"メーツァ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570107786461696","locale":"jp","text":"し～っ……さっき芽吹いた子が眠っているの。"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570112081428736","locale":"jp","text":"メーツァ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570112081428992","locale":"jp","text":"ふふっ、本当にいい子ね。"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570116376396032","locale":"jp","text":"メーツァ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570116376396288","locale":"jp","text":"ふむ……元気に育っているわね。"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570120671363328","locale":"jp","text":"メーツァ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570120671363584","locale":"jp","text":"きゃっ！もう……続けるなら、責任を取ってもらうわ。"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570124966330624","locale":"jp","text":"メーツァ"}
{"id":"home_dorm_story_text:459570124966330880","locale":"jp","text":"落ちた葉も、ちゃんと拾ってあげなくては。"}
